    <h3>Aging Clock - Interactive Biological-Age Dashboard</h3>
    <p>A live, hosted dashboard for the methylation aging clock. Move the sliders on the gene-labeled CpG sites the model weights most (OTUD7A, RASSF5, ZEB2, KCNQ1) and the predicted biological age updates in real time. Shows held-out accuracy of 5.65 years (Pearson r 0.892), a predicted-versus-real-age scatter on people the model never saw, and a per-site attention chart. Holds at 6.36 years on an independent 689-person cohort (GSE42861), the honest cross-study transfer number. Built with Streamlit and Altair.</p>
