    <h3>Epigenetic Aging Clock - DNA Methylation Biological-Age Predictor</h3>
    <p>Predicts biological age from whole-blood DNA methylation. Streams the public GSE40279 dataset (656 samples, about 450,000 CpG sites) with a memory-safe loader, then trains a cross-validated elastic-net regression that predicts age to within 5.65 years (Pearson r 0.892) on held-out samples using a sparse 176-CpG signature it selected itself. The residual estimates age acceleration. An enrichment test confirms the selected sites are significantly enriched for established Hannum blood-clock CpGs (hypergeometric p = 2.7e-06), evidence the pipeline recovered real age biology.</p>
